  "description": "The REVEAL – uncompromising design DNA for long distances. The lightweight frameset impresses with great comfort, outstanding power transfer and unbeatable value for money. This model is equipped with the SRAM Red eTap AXS groupset, the ROSE Carbon One-Piece Endurance cockpit, ROSE RC-Forty/Fifty Disc Carbon Race wheelset and Schwalbe Pro One TT classic skin 700x28c tyres. More power transfer The impressive BB86 bottom bracket and deep asymmetric chainstays guarantee outstanding power transfer. More comfort Deep seatstays and a full-integrated clamping of the comfortable ROSE D-shape seatpost provide you with various flex-levels and seating positions for more comfort. More integration A fully integrated cable routing solution on the headset gives the cockpit an ultra clean appearance. The REVEAL has proven perseverance on the road. An elegant endurance bike for long, comfortable rides. * approx. 7.1 kg, may vary by up to +/- 5 % due to manufacturing tolerances, weight for matt carbon/shiny laser gray frame, size 57 cm, without pedals Slight paint variations possible on the fork",
